deckle-kfxgen

This crate is a Rust port of kfxgen (https://github.com/jloutsch/kfxgen) at commit
0bc705d3ec9489417db5112ef8b40e57da938bed. The dump hook in tools/ref/kfxgen_hook runs inside
kfxgen and is covered by this notice too.

