crate and the hook are GPL-3.0-only, while the rest of Deckle is GPL-3.0-or-later. A program
built with this crate can be distributed under version 3. The licence text is the LICENSE file
at the root of the repository.

kfxgen includes a modified subset of kfxlib, from the KFX Input/Output plugins for calibre:

    Copyright (C) 2016-2025 John Howell <jhowell@acm.org>
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.

Parts of this crate follow kfxlib's behaviour as kfxgen uses it: how a decimal is written, the
approximate locations and pages, and the count of `YJ_symbols` entries. The symbol names in
src/generate/standard_symbols.rs are kfxgen's own (kfxgen's NOTICE), not kfxlib's.
